        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Campsite availability\n\nTwo lenses on the same campsite scrape:\n\n- **Right now \u2014 all nights (live)** \u2014 current system-wide state from Cloudflare Analytics Engine (`campsites_ae`), refreshed continuously: site-nights available/reserved summed across every tracked night, fully-booked campgrounds, per-agency split, per-campground latest, and watched hot dates. Independent of the date/agency filters.\n- **For a chosen night (`$target_date`) \u2014 history** \u2014 the daily InfluxDB snapshot (`campsites` bucket). Pick a night (+ optional agency/campsite) for its latest split and how it filled up over time (burn-down / forecast).\n\nThe time picker drives the history trend; the live section is always *now*."
      }
    },
